      "instance_name": "islamophobia",
      "label": "Islamophobia",
      "description": "The meme implicitly references the name 'Mohammed', which is a common Muslim name, and associates it with a bomb. This leverages the real-world stereotype that links Muslims or people with Muslim-sounding names to terrorism and violence, which is a core component of Islamophobia.",
